                "kind": "text",
                "x": 280,
                "y": 220,
                "text": "dangerous?",
                "size": 26,
                "color": "green",
                "anchor": "middle",
                "bold": true,
                "change": "add"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "Step three. Swap each option in. The right one keeps the meaning.",
          "write": "3. Swap"
        },
        {
          "say": "Dangerous fits a list of risks. Beautiful doesn't. Nor does long.",
          "write": "treacherous = dangerous"
        },
        {
          "say": "Read the sentence before and after too. Clues can be far away."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "The five context clues",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "Definition clues come after a dash, a comma, or the word means.",
          "write": "Definition: — , means"
        },
        {
          "say": "A synonym clue is a similar word nearby. Elated, truly overjoyed.",
          "write": "Synonym: elated, overjoyed"
        },
        {
          "say": "A contrast clue follows but, unlike or although.",
          "write": "Contrast: but • unlike • although"
        },
        {
          "say": "An example clue follows such as or like.",
          "write": "Example: such as"
        },
        {
          "say": "General sense uses the whole situation. Famished hikers ate everything.",
          "write": "General sense",
          "draw": {
            "type": "shapes",
            "width": 560,
            "height": 300,
            "alt": "Five clue types: DSCEG",
            "items": [
              {
                "kind": "rect",
                "x": 10,
                "y": 90,
                "w": 100,
                "h": 80,
                "fill": "blue",
                "label": "D"
              },
              {
                "kind": "rect",
                "x": 122,
                "y": 90,
                "w": 100,
                "h": 80,
                "fill": "orange",
                "label": "S"
              },
              {
                "kind": "rect",
                "x": 234,
                "y": 90,
                "w": 100,
                "h": 80,
                "fill": "green",
                "label": "C"
              },
              {
                "kind": "rect",
                "x": 346,
                "y": 90,
                "w": 100,
                "h": 80,
